          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- Every claim is checked in code: kata types are code, chat, whiteboard and review; today's kata comes from five-minute review katas; every evaluated kata counts for belts; Engawa only when the operator turns it on\n- Washi and Sumi only, following the system, with a toggle\n- Mobile-first; no web manifest (the instance app is the installable one)\n- Illustrations are brand art: no 'concept' captions, no claim that the app looks like them",
