              "fill": "$color-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A kata gives the attempt a boundary: one problem, a running timer and an explanation that has to be your own. A verdict describes this attempt; it is not a score for you.",
