                      "id": "SXr4S",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$color-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Code, chat, whiteboard or review: find the bug in a few lines and say why. Today's kata comes from the five-minute review katas. Junior, mid or senior, and the topics you choose, shape what you get.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
