                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$color-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "White to black, from completed katas, topic variety, active days and time at your rank. Every kata the sensei evaluates counts, whatever the verdict. A belt is not a certificate.",
